Use MAX_STATIC_DATA of 500000.
When play begins, seed the random-number generator with 1234.

container is a kind of thing.
door is a kind of thing.
object-like is a kind of thing.
supporter is a kind of thing.
food is a kind of object-like.
key is a kind of object-like.
containers are openable, lockable and fixed in place. containers are usually closed.
door is openable and lockable.
object-like is portable.
supporters are fixed in place.
food is edible.
A room has a text called internal name.


The r_11 and the r_8 and the r_12 and the r_13 and the r_14 and the r_15 and the r_17 and the r_16 and the r_18 and the r_19 and the r_2 and the r_1 and the r_4 and the r_5 and the r_6 and the r_7 and the r_9 and the r_10 and the r_0 and the r_3 are rooms.

Understand "restroom" as r_11.
The internal name of r_11 is "restroom".
The printed name of r_11 is "-= Restroom =-".
The restroom part 0 is some text that varies. The restroom part 0 is "You're now in a restroom. You can barely contain your excitement.

 You can make out a board. Make a note of this, you might have to put stuff on or in it later on. [if there is something on the s_0]You see [a list of things on the s_0] on the board. Suddenly, you bump your head on the ceiling, but it's not such a bad bump that it's going to prevent you from looking at objects and even things.[end if]".
The restroom part 1 is some text that varies. The restroom part 1 is "[if there is nothing on the s_0]But the thing is empty.[end if]".
The restroom part 2 is some text that varies. The restroom part 2 is " Oh, great. Here's a rack. The rack is usual.[if there is something on the s_1] On the rack you can see [a list of things on the s_1]. You check the price tag that the rack's owner still hasn't taken off. Two hundred bucks?! That's ridiculous! You know, I know a person, their pal works for the store, who could get you one of those for 15 bucks![end if]".
The restroom part 3 is some text that varies. The restroom part 3 is "[if there is nothing on the s_1] However, the rack, like an empty rack, has nothing on it.[end if]".
The restroom part 4 is some text that varies. The restroom part 4 is "

There is an unblocked exit to the south. There is an exit to the west. Don't worry, it is unblocked.".
The description of r_11 is "[restroom part 0][restroom part 1][restroom part 2][restroom part 3][restroom part 4]".

